resources.string:
1. You may choose to give us access to storage because you need to save the file locally; 
2. You may choose to give us access to camera to make it easy for you to feedback like taking and uploading photos; 
3. KingDraw needs your access to your device information (device status, device attributes, etc. ) to strengthen data security; 
4. The third-party SDK is integrated. The Privacy Policy provides instructions about what information we collect, and use; 
5. You can view the full version of the 《Terms of Service》 and 《Privacy Policy》 to understand how we collect, use, share, store and protect information.
